WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:14.369
Izzie and Nina were swinging high on the swings.

2
00:00:14.370 --> 00:00:17.901
They had just met at Kids Central a few weeks ago.

3
00:00:17.902 --> 00:00:20.346
But Izzie liked Nina.

4
00:00:20.347 --> 00:00:23.931
"Fall is my favorite season," Izzie said.

5
00:00:23.932 --> 00:00:31.220
"Yeah. I love fall too," Nina agreed.

6
00:00:31.221 --> 00:00:34.675
"Girls! Come get your sit-upons.

7
00:00:34.676 --> 00:00:38.224
You'll need them soon!" Miss Shelly called.

8
00:00:38.225 --> 00:00:41.897
It was time for the Kids Central activity of the day.

9
00:00:41.898 --> 00:00:48.422
"I wonder what we're doing," Izzie said.

10
00:00:48.423 --> 00:00:51.828
Miss Shelly was holding a brown paper bag.

11
00:00:51.829 --> 00:00:54.477
She wore tall rubber boots.

12
00:00:54.478 --> 00:00:59.197
"Out to the woods we go!" she said.

13
00:00:59.198 --> 00:01:02.154
Everyone followed Miss Shelly onto a path.

14
00:01:02.155 --> 00:01:06.725
The path went into the woods.

15
00:01:06.726 --> 00:01:09.744
"Here we are," Miss Shelly said.

16
00:01:09.745 --> 00:01:12.708
"Our campground for the day."

17
00:01:12.709 --> 00:01:16.223
"What are we doing here?" Izzie asked.

18
00:01:16.224 --> 00:01:20.480
"Can we put our sit-upons anywhere?" Bobby asked.

19
00:01:20.481 --> 00:01:25.294
"Anywhere that looks comfortable to sit," Miss Shelly answered.

20
00:01:25.295 --> 00:01:29.176
Miss Shelly emptied her shopping bag onto the ground.

21
00:01:29.177 --> 00:01:37.104
"For today's activity we'll use a fire, marshmallows, chocolate, and graham crackers.

22
00:01:37.105 --> 00:01:39.817
Can anyone guess what it is?"

23
00:01:39.818 --> 00:01:45.030
"S'mores!" Bobby yelled. "My favorite!"

24
00:01:45.031 --> 00:01:50.989
"Yum! My family makes s'mores when we go camping," Nina said.

25
00:01:50.990 --> 00:01:54.377
"What's a s'more?" Izzie asked.

26
00:01:54.378 --> 00:01:58.916
"What's a s'more?" Nina repeated, shocked.

27
00:01:58.917 --> 00:02:04.920
"You're in for a treat today, Izzie." Miss Shelly smiled.

28
00:02:04.921 --> 00:02:07.555
"First I'll make the fire.

29
00:02:07.556 --> 00:02:11.095
You should each find a long, skinny stick.

30
00:02:11.096 --> 00:02:13.345
Brush off any dirt.

31
00:02:13.346 --> 00:02:20.783
You can peel off the bark, if you'd like," Miss Shelly instructed.

32
00:02:20.784 --> 00:02:23.715
"Oh, I found a perfect one!"

33
00:02:23.716 --> 00:02:27.498
Nina said, brushing off a long stick.

34
00:02:27.499 --> 00:02:32.978
"We use these to roast the marshmallows," Jason told Izzie.

35
00:02:32.979 --> 00:02:38.339
"Yep. You put the marshmallow on the end of your stick. Like this."

36
00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:42.238
Bobby showed Izzie how to stab the marshmallow.

37
00:02:42.239 --> 00:02:44.707
Izzie held up her stick.

38
00:02:44.708 --> 00:02:47.104
"Okay, now what?"

39
00:02:47.105 --> 00:02:52.107
"Now let's roast these marshmallows!" Miss Shelly said.

40
00:02:52.108 --> 00:02:58.524
"Hold your stick carefully over the fire, but not in the fire."

41
00:02:58.525 --> 00:03:01.118
"I like mine gooey and dripping.

42
00:03:01.119 --> 00:03:04.325
That's the best," Nina said.

43
00:03:04.326 --> 00:03:11.148
"No way. Totally burnt and crispy on the outside is the best," Bobby said.

44
00:03:11.149 --> 00:03:13.723
Izzie screamed.

45
00:03:13.724 --> 00:03:17.282
"Miss Shelly! My marshmallow is on fire!"

46
00:03:17.283 --> 00:03:19.657
"Don't worry, Izzie.

47
00:03:19.658 --> 00:03:23.026
Just blow it out, like a birthday candle."

48
00:03:23.027 --> 00:03:28.138
Miss Shelly calmly took Izzie's stick and blew out the small flame.

49
00:03:28.139 --> 00:03:30.094
"So this is a s'more?"

50
00:03:30.095 --> 00:03:34.127
Izzie asked, holding up her burnt marshmallow.

51
00:03:34.128 --> 00:03:39.867
"Not yet. Now we take two graham crackers," Nina said.

52
00:03:39.868 --> 00:03:43.649
"And a piece of chocolate," Jason added.

53
00:03:43.650 --> 00:03:46.842
"Put your chocolate on one graham cracker.

54
00:03:46.843 --> 00:03:50.320
And put your marshmallow on top of the chocolate."

55
00:03:50.321 --> 00:03:52.898
Bobby showed her how.

56
00:03:52.899 --> 00:03:57.375
"Then put your other graham cracker on top, like a sandwich.

57
00:03:57.376 --> 00:04:00.193
And squish it together."

58
00:04:00.194 --> 00:04:02.900
Nina squished her sandwich.

59
00:04:02.901 --> 00:04:06.173
Melted chocolate dripped out of one side.

60
00:04:06.174 --> 00:04:12.627
Izzie and Nina laughed.

61
00:04:12.628 --> 00:04:14.853
"S'mores are so good!"

62
00:04:14.854 --> 00:04:18.146
Izzie wiped marshmallow off her lips.

63
00:04:18.147 --> 00:04:23.750
"Aren't they? They're perfect for a fall day." Miss Shelly smiled.

64
00:04:23.751 --> 00:04:27.087
Izzie looked around at the pretty fall leaves.

65
00:04:27.088 --> 00:04:29.829
Then she looked at her new friend Nina.

66
00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:31.976
Miss Shelly was right.

67
00:04:31.977 --> 00:04:36.549
Everything was perfectly perfect.
